nique solution of  $Ax=0.$\nAlso, the system \n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & k\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\n \nhas exactly one solution, and the lines $x+y=0$ and $x+ky=0$ intersect at exactly one point. \n\nTherefore, the true statement is as follows:\n\n*If $k\\ne 1$, then the system $[\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & k\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]$ has the unique zero solution.* $\\,✓$" 13194139535484 true] [17592186351566 1000 #edb/ref 17592186351567 13194139535484 true] [17592186351566 1000 #edb/ref 17592186351568 13194139535484 true] [17592186351566 1000 #edb/ref 17592186351569 13194139535484 true] [17592186351566 1000 #edb/ref 17592186351570 13194139535484 true] [17592186351566 1000 #edb/ref 17592186351571 13194139535484 true] [17592186351566 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535484 true] [17592186351566 1041 "selection" 13194139535484 true] [17592186351566 1104 #edb/ref 17592186351571 13194139535484 true] [17592186351566 1110 #uuid "266ea60b-4a4f-549a-9d0f-158bc22cdf50" 13194139535484 true] [17592186351567 1034 "det[\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & k\\end{aligned}]=0" 13194139535484 true] [17592186351567 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535484 true] [17592186351567 1111 #uuid "11e2ddf0-f804-5a30-980d-66304828d094" 13194139535484 true] [17592186351568 1034 "$[\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & k\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]$ has no solution" 13194139535484 true] [17592186351568 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535484 true] [17592186351568 1111 #uuid "5be870e4-e9bd-5937-987a-d79308c5cc3a" 13194139535484 true] [17592186351569 1034 "The lines $x+y=0$ and $x+ky=0$ are parallel" 13194139535484 true] [17592186351569 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535484 true] [17592186351569 1111 #uuid "4a2b59cd-65d9-5d5c-8608-f9aa1b253dd0" 13194139535484 true]